Hi:

I uploaded an app to my shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io/> account, and I want to let it run daily automatically. I added
invalidateLater(86400000)
and it works locally (after the app becomes idle for a while, it automatically runs again), but when uploaded to shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io/>, it doesn't work. I close the app, and wait for a day, and it wasn't ran automatically. I checked the log file and it confirmed that the app did not run.

Is there any way to let the shiny app run on shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io/> automatically without leaving the app open in the browser?

